<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-20T01:58:01.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-recap-rich-content-103e6307-730f-45a8-8ac9-536e9b7813d9",
        "text": "We started by organizing information with lists! `<ul>` for unordered items and `<ol>` for ordered steps made our content much clearer and easier to read.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/70b3ed90a748e0a62430b530f968810b-test-lesson-recap-rich-content-panel-1-ed75e713-cd0c-4607-9a03-e78416e3f437.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-recap-rich-content-034cd911-7800-42ec-bb1a-c72b00307517",
        "text": "Then, we brought our pages to life with images using the `<img>` tag! Adding visuals makes any website more engaging and fun to explore.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/347c3d0a0e009eeedbaf5680d21d293d-test-lesson-recap-rich-content-panel-2-4fe4b34f-85f8-4059-a6ef-b48a9bddbf32.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-recap-rich-content-67a4a68c-92ff-445e-9384-a5473a0b476e",
        "text": "And remember how we connected everything with hyperlinks using the `<a>` tag? Links let us navigate between pages, opening up a whole world of information!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f9b646317ece9ea55fc8e836670da8c2-test-lesson-recap-rich-content-panel-3-ffa08eb1-3f10-42f8-9a8c-9fd19a39267c.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-recap-rich-content-0dbdaa7b-a149-417a-9162-12d85db8e64b",
        "text": "By combining lists, images, and links, we transform plain text into rich, interactive web experiences. These elements make websites more user-friendly and informative.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/69dc0c3d624c0015f8864ad0bac0efab-test-lesson-recap-rich-content-panel-4-b30965e3-2935-413e-a8da-2179abc3e37c.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "test-lesson-recap-rich-content-bc4fa28c-68e2-4783-8af4-be80e9f9b297",
        "text": "Now you have powerful tools to create amazing web content! Think about how you can use these elements in your own projects and when you browse the web.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/be2d0ba2f44925f69762fe28b26c1b49-test-lesson-recap-rich-content-panel-5-a2cb2425-4302-4305-b152-26d2339b49f6.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Summarize the lesson, highlighting how lists, images, and hyperlinks enhance web content and user experience. Encourage students to think about how they can use these elements in future projects and everyday web browsing."
  },
